Saramā offers to fly secretly to Rāma with Sītā's message --- Sītā declines the flight and asks Rāvaṇa's resolve instead --- Saramā overhears Rāvaṇa counsel and returns swiftly --- Saramā tells how mother and elders urged return of Sītā --- Saramā tells Rāvaṇa refuses release and Rāma must kill him --- War drums shake the earth as guards lose heart